id: dedicated-spotter
name: Dedicated Spotter
talentCategory: racial
race: cerealian
prerequisites: Cerealian Race
description: >
  You serve a vital role in your team, calling out enemy weak points and coordinating the team’s offensive.
text: >
  Dedicated Spotter: You serve a vital role in your team, calling out enemy weak points and coordinating the team’s offensive.
  –Prerequisites: Cerealian Race
  (1)-[Passive]: While in the Spectator State, increase the Strike Rolls of your Allies by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If an Ally scores a Critical Result on a Strike or Wound Roll while you are in the Spectator State, increase the Damage Category of that Attacking Maneuver by 1 Category.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If an Ally uses an Attacking Maneuver while you are in the Spectator State, you may make that Attacking Maneuver a Called Shot.

---

[passive]
# (1) Spectator: your Allies' Strike Rolls 1(T), yours - the best of those holding it (chat.mjs spotterParts).
allow spotter.strike;
# (2) Spectator: an Ally's Critical Strike or Wound - its Damage Category a step up, once a Round; settled again, as it was (chat.mjs
# spotterCategory).
allow spotter.category;
# (3) Spectator: an Ally's Called Shot on their Attacking Maneuver - asked of you, once an Encounter, without its Action
# (use-maneuver.mjs applyModifiers).
allow spotter.calledShot;
